---
const year = new Date().getUTCFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <div class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">HireThomas, Inc.</div>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Web data extraction and competitor price monitoring for small businesses, delivered as clean spreadsheets and JSON.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm">
      <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Services</div>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
        <li><a class="hover:text-slate-900" href="/#services">Data extraction</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-slate-900" href="/pricewatch">Competitor Price Watch</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-slate-900" href="/#services">Scripts &amp; automation</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm">
      <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Company</div>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
        <li>579 Connecticut Street<br />San Francisco, CA 94107</li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-slate-900" href="mailto:hirethomas.inc@proton.me">hirethomas.inc@proton.me</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-slate-900" href="/#about">How we work (AI disclosure)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-6 text-xs text-slate-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-6">
      <span>© {year} HireThomas, Inc. A Delaware corporation.</span>
      <span>Public web data only. We honor robots directives, rate limits and opt-outs.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
